Copyright 2026 Andrey Vityuk

This product is a Rust port of the `absl::Cord` data structure from the
Abseil C++ Common Libraries (https://github.com/abseil/abseil-cpp),
Copyright The Abseil Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The algorithms, data layouts, constants and much of the documentation in this
crate are derived from Abseil's `absl/strings/cord*` and
`absl/strings/internal/cord_*` sources. The Cordz sampling/profiling layer and
the CRC checksum node were intentionally not ported.
